      "updated": 1779769531249,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Contains Express RequestHandlers. \n- getUserV1 - getUserV2 - getUsers\n- There will be only one controller with multiple\nmethods for each version if necessary. \n- Controller will call the presenters if needed to\nreturn the correct shape based on the version.\n-  Controller handles: \n    - req params, req body, calling the service,\nsending res.json(), passing error to next().",
      "fontSize": 14.17644964221426,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "lOyr53pWqu7A9N5m3lWsh",
      "originalText": "Contains Express RequestHandlers. \n- getUserV1 - getUserV2 - getUsers\n- There will be only one controller with multiple methods for each version if necessary. \n- Controller will call the presenters if needed to return the correct shape based on the version.\n-  Controller handles: \n    - req params, req body, calling the service, sending res.json(), passing error to next().",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
